 "rows": [
  {
   "caption": "Leave the fridge open / on a hot day,",
   "start": 0.13,
   "end": 2.35,
   "first_word_s": 0.2,
   "last_word_s": 1.58,
   "caption_lead_s": 0.07,
   "ok": true,
   "spoken": true
  },
  {
   "caption": "and the kitchen / gets warmer.",
   "start": 2.35,
   "end": 4.03,
   "first_word_s": 2.42,
   "last_word_s": 3.16,
   "caption_lead_s": 0.07,
   "ok": true,
   "spoken": true
  },
  {
   "caption": "So how can a cold box / heat a room?",
   "start": 4.03,
   "end": 6.23,
   "first_word_s": 4.1,
   "last_word_s": 5.52,
   "caption_lead_s": 0.07,
   "ok": true,
   "spoken": true
  },
  {
   "caption": "A fridge doesn't make cold. / It pumps heat.",
   "start": 6.23,
   "end": 9.08,
   "first_word_s": 6.3,
   "last_word_s": 8.16,
   "caption_lead_s": 0.07,
   "ok": true,
   "spoken": true
  },
  {
   "caption": "Cold fluid in the inside / coils evaporates,",
   "start": 9.08,
   "end": 12.02,
   "first_word_s": 9.15,
   "last_word_s": 10.81,
   "caption_lead_s": 0.07,
   "ok": true,
   "spoken": true
  },
  {
   "caption": "soaking up your / food's heat.",
   "start": 12.02,
   "end": 13.73,
   "first_word_s": 12.09,
   "last_word_s": 12.83,
   "caption_lead_s": 0.07,
   "ok": true,
   "spoken": true
  },
  {
   "caption": "A compressor squeezes it / hotter than the room,",
   "start": 13.73,
   "end": 16.33,
   "first_word_s": 13.8,
   "last_word_s": 15.64,
   "caption_lead_s": 0.07,
   "ok": true,
   "spoken": true
  },
  {
   "caption": "and coils outside the box / release that heat.",
   "start": 16.33,
   "end": 19.08,
   "first_word_s": 16.4,
   "last_word_s": 18.32,
   "caption_lead_s": 0.07,
   "ok": true,
   "spoken": true
  },
  {
   "caption": "Door open, that heat / just circles back,",
   "start": 19.08,
   "end": 21.2,
   "first_word_s": 19.15,
   "last_word_s": 20.75,
   "caption_lead_s": 0.07,
   "ok": true,
   "spoken": true
  },
  {
   "caption": "plus the motor's own.",
   "start": 21.2,
   "end": 22.93,
   "first_word_s": 21.27,
   "last_word_s": 22.17,
   "caption_lead_s": 0.07,
   "ok": true,
   "spoken": true
  },
  {
   "caption": "That's why air conditioners / dump their heat outdoors.",
   "start": 22.93,
   "end": 26.35,
   "first_word_s": 23.0,
   "last_word_s": 24.98,
   "caption_lead_s": 0.07,
   "ok": true,
   "spoken": true
  },
  {
   "caption": "Download Recall to turn your / study material into lessons.",
   "start": 26.35,
   "end": 30.0,
   "first_word_s": 26.45,
   "last_word_s": 29.03,
   "caption_lead_s": 0.1,
